{
  "name": "Asteria Scale EN-RU register fidelity regression set",
  "version": 1,
  "languagePair": "en-ru",
  "license": "CC0-1.0",
  "origin": "Original examples written for Asteria Scale; no corpus sentences were copied. Every expectedTranslation and expectedRegister is taken from the shipped sense inventory, never invented. Ethnic and sexuality slurs present in the source dictionary are deliberately excluded: they exercise nothing the coarse and sexual vocabulary here does not already exercise.",
